@startuml inter_process_communication

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

class "Logging Client" as LoggingClient <<Process>>
class "mw::log::DatarouterBackend" as Backend
class "mw::com::Receiver" as ClientReceiver
class "mw::com::Sender" as ClientSender
class "Datarouter" as Datarouter <<Process>>
class "mw::com::Sender" as DrSender
class "mw::com::Receiver" as DrReceiver
class "Shared Memory" as SharedMemory <<Shared Memory>>

LoggingClient --> Backend
Backend --> ClientReceiver
Backend --> ClientSender
Datarouter --> DrSender
Datarouter --> DrReceiver

LoggingClient --> SharedMemory : Creates and writes to\n/tmp/logging.<appid>.<uid>.shmem\nwith permissions 0644
Datarouter --> SharedMemory : Read-only access

ClientReceiver --> DrSender
ClientSender --> DrReceiver

note top of ClientReceiver : Instantiates side channel to receive messages from /mw_com/message_passing/logging.<app>.<uid>

note top of DrSender : Creates one sender per client for requests to the client.

note bottom of ClientSender : Sends replies from the client to Datarouter.

note bottom of DrReceiver : Shared receiver at /mw_com/message_passing/logging.datarouter_recv.

@enduml
